{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:67524","published":"2026-09-15T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-09-16T13:45:03.293037845Z","related":["CVE-2026-58649"],"summary":"Moderate: .NET 8.0 security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":".NET is a fast, lightweight and modular platform for creating cross platform applications that work on Linux, macOS and Windows. It particularly focuses on creating console applications, web applications and micro-services. .NET contains a runtime conforming to .NET Standards a set of framework libraries, an SDK containing compilers and a 'dotnet' application to drive everything.  \n\nSDK version: 8.0.131  \nRuntime version: 8.0.31  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * dotnet10.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet8.0: .NET Information Disclosure Vulnerability (CVE-2026-58649)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update .NET 8.0 to SDK 8.0.131 and Runtime 8.0.31 [almalinux-9.8.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-252247)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-runtime-8.0","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/aspnetcore-runtime-8.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.31-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:67524.json"}},{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-runtime-dbg-8.0","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/aspnetcore-runtime-dbg-8.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.31-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:67524.json"}},{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-targeting-pack-8.0","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/aspnetcore-targeting-pack-8.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYST